<title>USA: Donaldson Co completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Donaldson Co completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Donaldson Co Inc said Monday it completed the previously announced acquisition of the assets of the Armada Tube Group, including Armada Products Co and Lakeside Tube Fabricators Inc.</p>
<p>The acquisition agreement was announced in March.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Armada, with annual sales of more than $15 million, makes tubular assemblies for exhaust and other engine-related products for original equipment manufacturers (OEM).</p>
<p>&quot;The Armada Tube Group helps us fulfill our major strategic initiative of providing total systems solutions to our OEM clients, which means more products and better service for customers,&quot; Bill Van Dyke, chairman, said in a statement.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
